{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13411","headline":"秋夕会友 · 姚系","name":"秋夕会友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倦客易相失，懽游无良辰。\n忽然一夕间，稍慰阖家贫。\n白露下庭梧，孤琴始悲辛。\n回风入幽草，虫响满四邻。\n会遇更何时，持桮重殷勤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}